# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets out of it.
# Anything copied into an image layer is readable by anyone who pulls the image.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Frontend is deployed separately as a static site.
frontend/

# Tests are not needed in the runtime image.
Backend.Tests/

.git/
.github/
**/*.md
!README.md

# Secrets and local configuration - must never reach an image layer.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
